  "title": "Coast Guard rescues four boaters near Suisun Slough, California",
  "description": "A Coast Guard Air Station San Francisco helicopter crew transfers two boaters to Queen of the Valley Medical Center in Napa, California, May 12, 2018, after being hoisted from their vessel which ran aground near Suisun Slough. The boat ran aground with four people aboard. The other two boaters were hoisted by the helicopter crew and taken to Napa County Airport. (U.S. Coast Guard photo/Released)",
